"""Exact sections behind each control, for all 13 jurisdictions. Section numbers and headings were read in the official texts (November 2026).
Summaries are our own plain-language description, not the words of the law, and are not legal advice: the link opens the official wording.

SECTIONS[jurisdiction][control] = (instrument id, section, heading). A control with no entry keeps its general citation, with no section."""

